port peak-hour operations","Reliable autonomous navigation","Intelligent obstacle avoidance","Multi-robot fleet coordination","Centralized cloud management"],"ordered":false},{"t":"p","html":"The DINERBOT T10 is one of the flagship autonomous catering robots within our food service robotics portfolio. Designed for modern restaurants and hospitality environments, it combines autonomous delivery, intelligent navigation, interactive customer engagement, and centralized fleet management to improve operational efficiency and elevate the dining experience. It also features a large interactive display that can be used for branding, promotions, and customer communication."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" id=\"Capa_1\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512;\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g>\t<g>\t\t<path d=\"M456.354,334.396c-0.495-0.828-1.016-1.621-1.536-2.321c-5.171-7.228-12.86-12.006-21.632-13.449   c-8.73-1.442-17.579,0.614-24.781,5.786l-95.403,68.122h-99.669c-4.702,0-8.533-3.823-8.533-8.533s3.831-8.533,8.533-8.533H268.8   c16.469,0,29.867-13.397,29.867-29.867c0-0.094-0.009-0.879-0.017-0.964c-0.529-16.461-14.413-29.295-30.532-28.902h-111.01   c-9.839,0.085-19.422,3.61-26.974,9.907l-41.728,34.731c-1.946,1.63-3.072,4.028-3.072,6.562v102.4   c0,4.719,3.823,8.533,8.533,8.533h211.721c13.858-0.017,27.358-4.898,38.025-13.73l103.45-85.478   C461.116,368.648,465.195,349.21,456.354,334.396z M436.685,365.133L332.74,450.987c-7.629,6.315-17.28,9.796-27.162,9.813H102.4   v-89.865l38.664-32.188c4.54-3.78,10.283-5.897,16.12-5.948l111.206-0.008c7.074-0.009,12.979,5.342,13.21,12.809   c0,7.057-5.743,12.8-12.8,12.8h-55.467c-14.114,0-25.6,11.486-25.6,25.6s11.486,25.6,25.6,25.6h102.4   c1.775,0,3.507-0.555,4.975-1.587l97.638-69.726c3.516-2.526,7.791-3.507,12.075-2.825c4.275,0.708,8.0